<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.50 higher. Demand moderate to good on a light to moderate movement. Top $61.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			     Country			    Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2   230-260 LBS.  58.50-60.00 Few 58.00	 59.25-61.00</p>
